cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its reproducibility data, please cite the accompanying SAC-SQ+ manuscript and the archived software release."
title: "Collective Exclusion Certificates for Complete Regularization Paths under Interval-Valued Segment Costs"
version: "1.0.0"
abstract: >-
  Software and reproducibility artifacts for computing complete regularization paths
  under interval-valued segment costs and a shared continuous penalty. The release
  includes exact continuous witness-interval certification, exact closed-support
  filtering, archive-independent witness generation, fitted-cost acquisition source,
  frozen cost-box inputs, analytical constructions, and paired benchmark outputs.
authors:
